---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Custom Orders" description="How custom knitting and crochet orders work at Aavisutram.">
  <section class="section container" style="max-width: 760px;">
    <h1 class="section-title">Custom Orders</h1>
    <p>
      Most pieces can be made in a colour, size or yarn of your choice — and if you have a
      pattern or idea in mind, it's always worth asking.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size:1.3rem; margin-top:2rem;">How it works</h2>
    <ol style="padding-left: 1.2rem; color: var(--color-text);">
      <li style="margin-bottom:0.6rem;">Get in touch with what you have in mind — a photo or a rough description is enough to start.</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom:0.6rem;">We'll confirm details like size, colour, yarn and timeline, and let you know the price.</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom:0.6rem;">Once confirmed, your piece is made to order by hand.</li>
      <li>Delivery is arranged directly — currently taking orders within Denmark and India.</li>
    </ol>

    <p style="margin-top: 2rem;">
      For larger orders, a small, trusted circle of knitters may help bring a piece to life —
      every item is still checked and finished under the Aavisutram label.
    </p>

    <a class="btn" href="/contact" style="margin-top:1rem;">Start a custom order</a>
  </section>
</Layout>
